# Flixbox core rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/01-scope.md` before implementing features.
- Follow Accepted ADRs in `docs/adr/`; do not reopen them casually.
- MVP services: Gluetun, qBittorrent, Prowlarr, Byparr, Radarr, Sonarr, Bazarr, Unpackerr, Recyclarr, Decluttarr, Maintainerr, Seerr, Jellyfin, Homepage, Caddy, optional docker-socket-proxy.
- Out of MVP unless user expands scope: Lidarr, Readarr, SABnzbd, Whisper, Overseerr, Jellyseerr, Autobrr, Profilarr, Authelia, PowerShell CLI.
- Use Seerr (not Jellyseerr/Overseerr). Use Byparr as default CF bypass.
- Preserve `${DATA_DIR}:/data` hardlink contract including `torrents/incomplete`.
- Preserve VPN dual-mode: only qBit in Gluetun netns; publish qBit ports on Gluetun; mode-aware client URLs.
- Maintainerr defaults to Jellyfin; do not enable destructive cleanup rules by default.
- No secrets in git-tracked files.
- Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks.
- Canonical docs are English.
- Prefer phase order in `docs/06-development-guide.md`.
